Implemented issue #33: swapped `fumadocs-ui` for `@fumadocs/base-ui` repo-wide.

- Removed `fumadocs-ui`, added `@fumadocs/base-ui@16.15.0` and bumped `fumadocs-core` to `16.15.0` to match its peer requirement (confirmed via `pnpm peers check` — clean).
- Rewrote every `fumadocs-ui/...` import (provider, layouts, page, mdx, `components/inline-toc`, CSS presets) to `@fumadocs/base-ui/...` in `src/app/layout.tsx`, `layout.config.tsx`, `(home)/layout.tsx`, `docs/layout.tsx`, `docs/[[...slug]]/page.tsx`, `content/docs/components.mdx`, and `lib/styles/globals.css`.
- Verified each renamed import's target against the installed `@fumadocs/base-ui` source/`.d.ts` files (not assumed identical): `RootProvider`'s static search config, `DocsLayoutProps.tabs.transform` signature (sidebar tab-icon transform), `HomeLayout`/`BaseLayoutProps` nav shape, and `DocsPage`/mdx exports all match.
- Both `@fumadocs/base-ui@16.15.0` and `fumadocs-core@16.15.0` were freshly published and blocked by pnpm's `minimumReleaseAge` gate; added `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` entries for both (with an explanatory comment) since excluding only one left an unmet peer.
- Updated the stale `fumadocs-ui` import path in `docs/reference/fumadocs/root-provider.md` to keep the reference doc in sync.
- `tsc --noEmit` and `eslint .` both pass clean. Ran `/code-review`'s Standards and Spec sub-agents against `origin/epic/28-refactor-ui-base-ui-shadcn`; both came back clean aside from the two items above, which I fixed.
- `pnpm dev` smoke test: `/docs`, `/docs/atelier`, `/docs/xeniapolis`, `/docs/components` all rendered 200 with correct titles. `pnpm build` and `pnpm dev` compiling `/api/search` both get OOM-killed in this sandbox (1.9GB RAM) — I confirmed by reverting to original `fumadocs-ui` deps that this reproduces identically, so it's a pre-existing sandbox memory constraint, not a regression from this change.
- Committed as `55a1c76`.

